<title>GERMANY: G7 finmins, central bankers to meet Berlin Feb 8.</title>
<headline>G7 finmins, central bankers to meet Berlin Feb 8.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance ministers and central bank chiefs from the Group of Seven (G7) industrialised nations will meet in Berlin on February 8 to discuss wide-ranging economic issues, a German Finance Ministry spokesman said on Friday.</p>
<p>The spokesman said the gathering will be similar to a G7 meeting held in Paris last year.</p>
<p>The spokesman said German finance minister Theo Waigel would discuss preparations for the introduction of the Euro and how it would impact on the international foreign exchange system.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
